00:58:41.000 --> 00:59:06.000
And third, it produced measurable symptom changes, supposedly. So if you administered the pHQ 9, which is a depression questionnaire before treatment, and then after treatment, you could see if the therapy had done anything. Now, granted, you're just looking for that one thing, but that's what we wanted to do at this time. This wasn't an analysis of the soul. It wasn't a reconfiguring of your values. It wasn't a construction of meaning. It was you have this one diagnosis.

